# The scaffold's own ignore rules are shipped content now: they travel as
# `scaffold/gitignore` and are emitted as .gitignore, because npm pack drops
# every file with that name from a tarball. So they no longer govern this
# tree, and the transient output of working inside the template is listed
# here — one directory up, where the scaffold never copies it (found live:
# npm pack --dry-run listed scaffold/system/site/out/, 2026-08-18).
scaffold/.ksor/
scaffold/**/node_modules/
scaffold/system/site/.next/
scaffold/system/site/.source/
scaffold/system/site/out/
scaffold/**/*.tsbuildinfo
scaffold/.env*
scaffold/**/.DS_Store
